      "text": "seasonality, and enhance innovation and creation. Spill-over effects to other sectors would be expected\nby attracting conferences to the country."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_003",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 283.0,
        "y1": 478.0,
        "x2": 2195.0,
        "y2": 672.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9421523809432983,
      "reading_order": 4,
      "text": "The Ministry of Tourism, GOI, (hereinafter referred to as “MOT”) considers MICE as one of the\ninitiatives of identifying, diversifying, developing and promoting niche products of the country. Medical\nand wellness tourism, eco-tourism and sustainable tourism are also identified as niche tourism products."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_004",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 284.0,
        "y1": 715.0,
        "x2": 2197.0,
        "y2": 912.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9339722394943237,
      "reading_order": 5,
      "text": "The draft national tourism policy 2015 laid strong emphasis on MICE Tourism by maximizing synergies\nbetween leisure and MICE Tourism. This aims to provide for pre and post leisure for MICE visitors\nmotivating them to visit nearby locations."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_005",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 284.0,
        "y1": 957.0,
        "x2": 2196.0,
        "y2": 1218.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9455323815345764,
      "reading_order": 6,
      "text": "According to the latest ICCA (International Congress and Convention Association) Statistics Report,\nmore than 12,000 large scale meetings have been organized in all countries across the world and 2,546\nmeetings in Asia Pacific & Middle East in 2015. As per the report, India ranks in the 31st position in the\nworld and 7th in Asia Pacific & Middle East."
    },
