      "layout_tag": "section-title",
      "confidence": 0.8502277731895447,
      "reading_order": 13,
      "text": "(2) ICPB (India Convention Promotion Bureau)"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_013",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 284.0,
        "y1": 2357.0,
        "x2": 2194.0,
        "y2": 2688.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9492055773735046,
      "reading_order": 14,
      "text": "MOT of GOI has taken several initiatives to promote the MICE industry in India. The ICPB (India\nConvention Promotion Bureau) was established in 1988, a non-profit organization, with members\ncomprising national airlines, hotels, travel agents, tour operators, tourist transport operators, conference\norganizers, etc. for promoting India more effectively as a convention destination.\nThe objectives of ICPB are:"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_014",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 342.0,
        "y1": 2733.0,
        "x2": 1831.0,
        "y2": 2789.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.8508095741271973,
      "reading_order": 15,
      "text": "- To promote India as a venue for International Congresses and Conventions."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_015",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 343.0,
        "y1": 2837.0,
        "x2": 2192.0,
        "y2": 2959.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9216814637184143,
      "reading_order": 16,
      "text": "- To undertake a continuing program of creating awareness of the role and benefits of Congresses\nand Conventions in the context of national objectives."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_3_block_016",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 340.0,
        "y1": 3008.0,
        "x2": 2196.0,
        "y2": 3129.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9109262824058533,
      "reading_order": 17,
      "text": "- To undertake research on the international conference market for development of India’s\nconference industry"
    },
